Stationary/logs/
Stationary/.mplcache/
Stationary/.venv/
ldc/figures/
ldc/*.npy

# Clementina XXI: job logs written next to the scripts by clementina/*.sbatch
clementina/*.out
clementina/*.err
clementina/__pycache__/

# Hub (serafin) and git worktrees: notebook checkpoints, git's own FETCH_HEAD, a stray
# scratch notebook, and the vendored reference copy that `pinn.reference` loads at run time
# (byte-identical to ldc/reference_gen/ldc_reference.npz, so it must not be tracked twice;
# it is regenerated on the hub with
#   cp ldc/reference_gen/ldc_reference.npz Evolution_try/vendor/dsgnar_pinn/pinn/references/ldc.npz ).
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
FETCH_HEAD
Stationary/Untitled.ipynb
Evolution_try/vendor/dsgnar_pinn/pinn/references/
